# ACN-Portal reference

Use the official documentation below for exact signatures and behavior. Do not
copy the whole API into project code or this rule.

## ACN-Data

- [ACN-Data overview](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acndata/index.html)
- [DataClient](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acndata/data_client.html)

Use `DataClient.get_sessions_by_time` for historical-session ingestion. Keep API
pulling, raw-field normalization, validation, and CSV snapshots in
`chargeopt.data`.

## ACN-Sim

- [Simulator](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/simulator.html)
- [Interface](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/interface.html)
- [ChargingNetwork](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/network/charging_network.html)
- [Current](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/network/current.html)
- [Sites](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/network/sites.html)
- [Events](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/events/events.html)
- [EventQueue](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/events/event_queue.html)
- [Analysis](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/analysis.html)
- [Models](https://acnportal.readthedocs.io/en/latest/acnsim/models.html)

ACN-Sim owns network, event, scheduler, charging, and simulation mechanics.
Consult it before reimplementing equivalent simulator behavior.

## Project boundary

- ACN-Data supplies real charging-session behavior for demand calibration.
- MVP vehicle telemetry and geo-distributed stations remain synthetic.
- ACN-Sim is a later comparison/integration path, not an excuse to expand MVP 1.
- Keep project-specific demand features, policies, and evaluation in
  `chargeopt`; use ACN-Portal for documented upstream capabilities.
